<view class="list-page">
  <view class="list-intro"><view class="brand-lockup"><view class="brand-symbol"></view><view><view class="brand-name">京考择校指南</view><view class="brand-edition">MY DECISION LIST</view></view></view><view class="list-title">我的志愿单</view><view class="list-copy">把偏好、专业与梯度放在一起。<br/>这是一份个人核对清单，不是录取承诺。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{count}}" class="analysis-panel"><view class="analysis-title">方案结构检查</view><view class="analysis-summary">{{analysis.summary}}</view><view class="structure-counts"><text wx:for="{{analysis.counts}}" wx:key="label">{{item.label}} {{item.value}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{analysis.issues}}" wx:key="title" class="analysis-issue"><view>{{item.title}}</view><text>{{item.detail}}</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{count}}" class="list-summary"><text>已收藏 {{count}} 个专业组</text><text>按意愿排序</text></view>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="candidateId" class="saved-row"><view class="saved-order">{{item.order}}</view><view class="saved-main"><view class="saved-name">{{item.collegeName}}</view><view class="saved-meta">2026 {{item.targetGroupName}} · {{item.level}}档参考</view><view class="saved-detail">选科 {{item.subjectRequirement}}｜2025 参考位次 {{item.referenceRankText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.matchedMajorText}}" class="saved-major">意向专业：{{item.matchedMajorText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.inverted}}" class="inversion-note">位次比上一项更靠前，请确认是主动偏好还是顺序需要调整。</view>
    <view class="decision-field"><view class="decision-label">若进入该专业组，我能接受哪些专业？</view><view class="decision-options"><view class="{{item.acceptance === 'selected' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.candidateId}}" data-field="majorAcceptance" data-value="selected" bindtap="handleDecision">仅意向专业</view><view class="{{item.acceptance === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.candidateId}}" data-field="majorAcceptance" data-value="all" bindtap="handleDecision">接受组内专业</view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.majorRisk}}" class="major-risk">{{item.majorRisk}}</view>
    <view class="saved-actions"><button size="mini" disabled="{{item.isFirst}}" data-id="{{item.candidateId}}" data-direction="-1" bindtap="handleMove">上移</button><button size="mini" disabled="{{index === count - 1}}" data-id="{{item.candidateId}}" data-direction="1" bindtap="handleMove">下移</button><button size="mini" class="remove" data-id="{{item.candidateId}}" bindtap="handleRemove">移除</button></view>
  </view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{ready && !count}}" class="empty-list"><view class="empty-symbol">＋</view><view class="empty-title">志愿单还是空的</view><view class="empty-copy">回到推荐池，先收藏真正愿意去的专业组。</view></view>
  <button wx:if="{{count}}" class="copy-button" bindtap="handleCopy">复制清单与风险核对项</button><view class="list-notice">系统只检查结构与已填写偏好，不判断是否“稳录”。提交前请逐项核对当年招生章程、专业调剂规则及北京教育考试院志愿系统。</view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="handleBack">继续挑选专业组</button>
</view>